arm64: dts: qcom: x1-asus-vivobook-s15: let the panel switch off its 3.3 V

VREG_EDP_3P3 only feeds the Samsung ATNA56AC03 OLED panel, whose driver
powers it via runtime PM. regulator-always-on kept the panel powered in
s2idle; keep boot-on so the bootloader handoff stays seamless.

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x1-asus-vivobook-s15.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x1-asus-vivobook-s15.dtsi
@@ -208,7 +208,6 @@
 		pinctrl-0 = <&edp_reg_en>;
 		pinctrl-names = "default";
 
-		regulator-always-on;
 		regulator-boot-on;
 	};
 
